{
  "_comment": "Overrides cluster destinations for the docker-compose stack, where services are reachable by their compose service name (e.g. user-service-api) rather than the Kubernetes service name baked into yarp.json (e.g. lante-user-service). Loaded only when ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT=DockerCompose (set on the lante-gateway service in Deployment/docker-compose.yml) \u2014 the k8s deployment uses ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT=Production and only ever supplies yarp.json via its ConfigMap, so it never sees this file.",
